-- A direct platform session can be rotated into a tenant without rewriting
-- its protected OIDC material.  Keep the original platform AAD immutable and
-- resolve the one attested active owner through the durable switch ledger and
-- tenant-platform provenance.  Other authorities retain their physical owner.
CREATE FUNCTION app.private_oidc_material_effective_session_v1(
  p_material_id uuid
)
RETURNS TABLE (
  material_id uuid,
  session_id uuid,
  tenant_id uuid,
  authority text,
  binding_id uuid
)
LANGUAGE sql
STABLE
SECURITY DEFINER
SET search_path = pg_catalog, public, app
AS $function$
  WITH RECURSIVE source AS MATERIALIZED (
    SELECT material.id,material.session_id,material.tenant_id,
           material.authority,material.binding_id,material.user_id,
           material.provider_id,material.external_identity_id,
           material.rotation_family_id
    FROM public.tenant_oidc_session_materials AS material
    WHERE material.id = p_material_id
      AND material.session_id IS NOT NULL
      AND material.continuation_id IS NULL
  ), initial_switch AS MATERIALIZED (
    SELECT source.id AS material_id,target.id AS session_id,
           switch.target_tenant_id AS tenant_id,
           'tenant_platform_provider'::text AS authority,
           switch.binding_id,source.user_id,source.provider_id,
           source.external_identity_id,source.rotation_family_id,
           target.created_at,0::integer AS depth
    FROM source
    JOIN public.platform_oidc_tenant_switch_commands AS switch
      ON source.authority = 'platform_provider'
     AND source.tenant_id IS NULL
     AND source.binding_id IS NULL
     AND switch.source_session_id = source.session_id
     AND switch.decision = 'rotated'
    JOIN public.auth_sessions AS target
      ON target.id = switch.rotated_session_id
     AND target.user_id = source.user_id
     AND target.rotation_family_id = source.rotation_family_id
     AND target.active_tenant_id = switch.target_tenant_id
     AND target.authentication_method = 'oidc'
    JOIN public.auth_session_tenant_platform_federated_provenance AS provenance
      ON provenance.tenant_id = switch.target_tenant_id
     AND provenance.session_id = target.id
     AND provenance.user_id = source.user_id
     AND provenance.primary_kind = 'tenant_platform_provider'
     AND provenance.authentication_method = 'oidc'
     AND provenance.platform_provider_id = source.provider_id
     AND provenance.binding_id = switch.binding_id
     AND provenance.external_identity_id = source.external_identity_id
  ), lineage AS (
    SELECT initial_switch.* FROM initial_switch
    UNION ALL
    SELECT lineage.material_id,target.id,lineage.tenant_id,lineage.authority,
           lineage.binding_id,lineage.user_id,lineage.provider_id,
           lineage.external_identity_id,lineage.rotation_family_id,
           target.created_at,lineage.depth + 1
    FROM lineage
    JOIN public.auth_sessions AS target
      ON target.rotated_from_session_id = lineage.session_id
     AND target.user_id = lineage.user_id
     AND target.rotation_family_id = lineage.rotation_family_id
     AND target.active_tenant_id = lineage.tenant_id
    JOIN public.auth_session_tenant_platform_federated_provenance AS provenance
      ON provenance.tenant_id = lineage.tenant_id
     AND provenance.session_id = target.id
     AND provenance.user_id = lineage.user_id
     AND provenance.primary_kind = 'tenant_platform_provider'
     AND provenance.authentication_method = 'oidc'
     AND provenance.platform_provider_id = lineage.provider_id
     AND provenance.binding_id = lineage.binding_id
     AND provenance.external_identity_id = lineage.external_identity_id
    WHERE lineage.depth < 1024
  ), switched AS MATERIALIZED (
    SELECT lineage.material_id,lineage.session_id,lineage.tenant_id,
           lineage.authority,lineage.binding_id
    FROM lineage
    WHERE lineage.depth = (
      SELECT max(candidate.depth) FROM lineage AS candidate
      WHERE candidate.material_id = lineage.material_id
    )
      AND NOT EXISTS (
        SELECT 1 FROM lineage AS ambiguous
        WHERE ambiguous.material_id = lineage.material_id
        GROUP BY ambiguous.depth HAVING count(*) > 1
      )
  )
  SELECT switched.material_id,switched.session_id,switched.tenant_id,
         switched.authority,switched.binding_id
  FROM switched
  UNION ALL
  SELECT source.id,source.session_id,source.tenant_id,source.authority,
         source.binding_id
  FROM source
  WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM switched)
    AND NOT EXISTS (
      SELECT 1
      FROM public.platform_oidc_tenant_switch_commands AS switch
      WHERE source.authority = 'platform_provider'
        AND source.tenant_id IS NULL
        AND source.binding_id IS NULL
        AND switch.source_session_id = source.session_id
        AND switch.decision = 'rotated'
    );
$function$;
--> statement-breakpoint
